RustDesk signing certificate — provenance
================================================================================

The RustDesk code-signing certificate embedded in
`src/appcontrol/Build-RmmAppControl.v*.ps1` is not sourced from LOLRMM, which
publishes no certificate data for RustDesk. It is public certificate data taken
from the vendor's official Windows release:

    subject CN       PURSLANE
    issuer           Sectigo EV Code Signing CA (R36)
    SHA-1 thumbprint 4230334F8A7DD84E50D0273EF379E8B4A82F5DA5
    valid to         2028-02-23
    source           rustdesk-1.5.0-x86_64.exe / rustdesk-1.5.0-x86-sciter.exe
                     (official RustDesk Windows build)

No RustDesk binary or installer is included in this repository.

================================================================================
Microsoft
================================================================================

The App Control policies are based on Microsoft's example policy template
`%windir%\\schemas\\CodeIntegrity\\ExamplePolicies\\AllowAll.xml` and follow
the documented recommended block-rule layout. No Microsoft file is redistributed.

